338
00:27:44,020 --> 00:27:45,908
So they gave her now glad tidings.

339
00:27:45,988 --> 00:27:51,710
We also came to give you the glad tidings that you will have a son; his name will be his Is'haq(إسحاق)

340
00:27:51,948 --> 00:27:55,829
and then your son Is'haq(إسحاق), will have a son and he is Yaqoob(يعقوب).

341
00:27:58,043 --> 00:28:01,218
She slapped her face

342
00:28:02,107 --> 00:28:03,059
 فسكت وجه

343
00:28:03,170 --> 00:28:09,150
she slapped her face and said I am an old woman and my husband is old.

344
00:28:09,488 --> 00:28:11,258
How can we have a child ?

345
00:28:11,496 --> 00:28:12,534
إِنَّ هٰذا لَشَيءٌ عَجيبٌ

346
00:28:12,594 --> 00:28:14,362
She said: This is a strange thing.

347
00:28:15,592 --> 00:28:20,623
She slapped her face, in amazement and she fround.

348
00:28:21,520 --> 00:28:23,187
هذا امرٌ عجيب ، هٰذا لَشَيءٌ عَجيبٌ

349
00:28:23,217 --> 00:28:24,545
This is a strange thing.

350
00:28:25,005 --> 00:28:25,956
The angels told her;

351
00:28:25,986 --> 00:28:27,598
أَتَعجَبينَ مِن أَمرِ اللَّهِ ۖ

352
00:28:28,449 --> 00:28:31,797
Is the order and commandment of Allah; Strange.

353
00:28:32,051 --> 00:28:37,913
This is there's nothing strange; Allah سبحانه وتعالى - Kunfa Yakoon(كن فيكون), he will tell anything to be, and it will become.

354
00:28:38,757 --> 00:28:55,511
وَٱمْرَأَتُهُۥ قَآئِمَةٌ فَضَحِكَتْ فَبَشَّرْنَٰهَا بِإِسْحَٰقَ وَمِن وَرَآءِ إِسْحَٰقَ يَعْقُوبَ۝

355
00:28:55,876 --> 00:29:03,308
They said: Do you wonder at the decree of Allah, the mercy of Allah and His Blessings to be on you - Oh family of Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم).

356
00:29:03,459 --> 00:29:06,237
Surely He; Allah is all praised in, and all glorious.

357
00:29:06,578 --> 00:29:09,240
رحمة الله وبركاته عليكم اهل البيت

358
00:29:09,580 --> 00:29:16,199
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى is giving the blessings and the mercy on the household of Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم), it's the blessed household.

359
00:29:17,080 --> 00:29:22,134
Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) and Sara(سارة) received the glad tidings of a son.

360
00:29:23,300 --> 00:29:25,015
They were given the glad tidings.

361
00:29:25,435 --> 00:29:29,697
And this is after Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) already had his son; Ismail(اِسْماعِيْل).

362
00:29:30,563 --> 00:29:33,364
They were very old in age maybe over 100 years old.

363
00:29:35,483 --> 00:29:40,450
They're given the news that they would have a child and his name would be Is'haq(إسحاق).

364
00:29:42,013 --> 00:29:44,489
And then after Is'haq(إسحاق); Yaqoob(يعقوب),

365
00:29:45,053 --> 00:29:52,214
the Jews say that Is'haq(إسحاق) was the one, who was sacrificed and not Ismail(اِسْماعِيْل).

366
00:29:53,864 --> 00:29:56,526
Now, how can Is'haq(إسحاق) to be sacrificed?

367
00:29:57,105 --> 00:30:02,847
When Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) and Sara(سارة) were told that Is'haq(إسحاق) would live and would have a son and his son would Yaqoob(يعقوب).

368
00:30:03,728 --> 00:30:07,003
What's the point in telling Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) to sacrifice Is'haq(إسحاق)

369
00:30:07,397 --> 00:30:11,676
if Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) already knows that Is'haq(إسحاق) would live and would have son and his son is Yaqoob(يعقوب).

370
00:30:12,827 --> 00:30:16,454
This shows you that the Jews, because of their jealousy and hatred,

371
00:30:16,484 --> 00:30:19,724
they tried to change everything, take everything from Ismail(اِسْماعِيْل) and give it to Is'haq(إسحاق).

372
00:30:19,754 --> 00:30:23,534
All of them are the Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء) of Allah and Allah gives honoring to whomever He wills.

373
00:30:25,479 --> 00:30:27,241
Anyway, this is something on the side.

374
00:30:27,376 --> 00:30:35,114
Now, in this meeting, the angels delivered this news that you would have a child and his name is Is'haq(إسحاق).

375
00:30:35,288 --> 00:30:37,503
Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) is thinking about something else.

376
00:30:38,963 --> 00:30:40,798
Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) is concerned;

377
00:30:41,830 --> 00:30:47,528
we would expect that Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) would be concerned about the news that he would have a son;

378
00:30:47,663 --> 00:30:48,218
No.

379
00:30:48,377 --> 00:30:50,195
He was thinking about something else.

380
00:30:51,044 --> 00:30:53,606
He's thanked Allahسُبحانه وتعالى that Allah will give him Is'haq(إسحاق)

381
00:30:53,669 --> 00:30:57,709
but he is concerned, he's thinking about something else at that moment.

382
00:30:57,971 --> 00:31:01,857
And he just waited and then the conversation about Is'haq(إسحاق) and Yaqoob(يعقوب) was over.

383
00:31:02,008 --> 00:31:02,865
And then he said;

384
00:31:03,095 --> 00:31:17,149
فَلَمّا ذَهَبَ عَن إِبراهيمَ الرَّوعُ وَجاءَتهُ البُشرىٰ يُجادِلُنا في قَومِ لوطٍ۝

385
00:31:17,760 --> 00:31:25,914
إِنَّ إِبراهيمَ لَحَليمٌ أَوّاهٌ مُنيبٌ۝

386
00:31:26,232 --> 00:31:29,802
Then when the fear had gone away from the mind of Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم)

387
00:31:29,973 --> 00:31:35,432
and the glad tidings has reached him, he began to plead with us for the people have Lut(لوط).

388
00:31:36,797 --> 00:31:38,693
Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) was concerned.

389
00:31:39,257 --> 00:31:41,817
The angels said that they will destroy the people of Lut(لوط).

390
00:31:41,944 --> 00:31:43,841
The Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) was concerned for two reasons.

391
00:31:44,087 --> 00:31:46,869
First of all, Lut(لوط) was still there.

392
00:31:48,686 --> 00:31:52,377
And in another Ayah(آية), Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) is telling the angels Lut(لوط) is there.

393
00:31:53,845 --> 00:32:00,097
Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) is concerned because his nephew, the righteous Nabi(نَبِي) of Allah; Lut(لوط) is still in the village.

394
00:32:00,923 --> 00:32:04,715
And Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) thought that maybe the punishment will come and destroy everyone in the village.

395
00:32:05,509 --> 00:32:12,826
And Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) also because of his gentleness, and His mercy; he was pleading for the people of Lut(لوط).

396
00:32:12,856 --> 00:32:17,064
He wanted to give them another chance maybe they would repent to Allah and believe;

397
00:32:18,628 --> 00:32:23,192
so he's pleading for them, give them another chance, but the angels told him;

398
00:32:23,700 --> 00:32:44,698
يا إِبراهيمُ أَعرِض عَن هٰذا ۖ إِنَّهُ قَد جاءَ أَمرُ رَبِّكَ ۖ وَإِنَّهُم آتيهِم عَذابٌ غَيرُ مَردودٍ۝

399
00:32:44,983 --> 00:32:49,632
O Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) leave this issue alone; Leave this matter alone.

400
00:32:49,944 --> 00:32:51,910
إِنَّهُ قَد جاءَ أَمرُ رَبِّكَ ۖ

401
00:32:51,989 --> 00:32:54,386
The order of Allah has already been revealed.

402
00:32:54,957 --> 00:32:56,543
There's no change in it;

403
00:32:56,767 --> 00:32:58,383
you cannot plead for this;

404
00:32:58,597 --> 00:33:00,378
you cannot make any Shafa'a(شفاعة) in this.

405
00:33:00,581 --> 00:33:04,524
The order of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى the commandment of Allah has already descended.

406
00:33:04,984 --> 00:33:05,984
And they said;

407
00:33:06,111 --> 00:33:09,889
وَإِنَّهُم آتيهِم عَذابٌ غَيرُ مَردودٍ۝

408
00:33:10,185 --> 00:33:16,816
And verily there will come a tournament for them that cannot be turned back.

409
00:33:17,308 --> 00:33:20,415
The punishment there is no way it can be turned back; that's it.

410
00:33:22,185 --> 00:33:23,495
The angels left,

411
00:33:24,130 --> 00:33:28,717
they came to Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) to deliver to him news and that is Is'haq(إسحاق) and Yaqoob(يعقوب)

412
00:33:29,122 --> 00:33:33,235
and they left on their way to fulfill their mission.

413
00:33:34,201 --> 00:33:35,679
They're heading to Sadoom(سدوم).

414
00:33:38,338 --> 00:33:41,156
When they reach to the outskirts of the town.

415
00:33:43,156 --> 00:33:46,511
It is said that the first one, who saw them was the daughter of Lut(لوط).

416
00:33:48,741 --> 00:33:54,489
She saw these three handsome young men she immediately rushed towards her father

417
00:33:56,193 --> 00:34:00,993
and told him: My father, there are three young handsome men coming in town.

418
00:34:02,751 --> 00:34:06,323
The father immediately rushed outside, to meet them,

419
00:34:06,759 --> 00:34:09,846
and to tell them; Be my guests.

420
00:34:10,519 --> 00:34:13,963
Because Lut(لوط) knows if they are not his guests,

421
00:34:14,273 --> 00:34:16,900
they're going to be guests with somebody else in the people of Sadoom(سدوم).

422
00:34:17,951 --> 00:34:20,983
If he does not take care of them, they would be in trouble.

423
00:34:21,634 --> 00:34:24,253
And these are three young handsome men.

424
00:34:25,753 --> 00:34:33,129
Lut(لوط) was walking into the town, he was walking in front of them to make sure that nobody will see them.

425
00:34:33,336 --> 00:34:35,058
If they're seen they would be in trouble.

426
00:34:36,317 --> 00:34:43,021
So he's leading them in the streets of the town and then Lut(لوط), looked back at them and said;

427
00:34:43,847 --> 00:34:49,054
ولله ما أعلم على وجه الأرض أحد أفسد نهاية من هذه القرية

428
00:34:49,569 --> 00:34:57,239
 He said: In the name of Allah, I don't know of anyone on the face of the earth who is more evil than these people.

429
00:34:58,128 --> 00:35:00,112
They didn't respond.

430
00:35:01,231 --> 00:35:03,027
He turned again to them and said;

431
00:35:03,947 --> 00:35:10,273
In the name of Allah, I don't know that there's anyone on the face of the earth more evil than these people.

432
00:35:11,566 --> 00:35:12,860
What is Lut(لوط) trying to do?

433
00:35:13,289 --> 00:35:16,279
Lut(لوط) does not want to tell them; leave.

434
00:35:16,619 --> 00:35:18,730
He doesn't want to say explicitly leave.

435
00:35:19,294 --> 00:35:23,213
Because they might interpret it as he doesn't want to host us.

436
00:35:23,806 --> 00:35:26,057
So let's leave him alone and go and find somebody else.

437
00:35:26,279 --> 00:35:27,200
He doesn't want to do that.

438
00:35:27,351 --> 00:35:30,708
Because he knows if they go and find another host, they would be in trouble.

439
00:35:31,446 --> 00:35:35,220
But he wants to give them a correct assessment of the situation.

440
00:35:36,768 --> 00:35:39,419
He thinks that these are foreigners, they don't know what's going on.

441
00:35:39,728 --> 00:35:43,347
So he wants to tell them; Do you know where you're going?

442
00:35:43,641 --> 00:35:45,307
Do you know what town is this?

443
00:35:45,609 --> 00:35:47,585
Do you know the evil that is happening here?

444
00:35:47,942 --> 00:35:50,426
So that they would take the initiative and leave on their own.

445
00:35:51,689 --> 00:35:54,984
And he kept on doing that again and again, three or four or five times?

446
00:35:55,254 --> 00:36:00,241
Every now and then he would turn back and say these are the most evil people; these people are corrupt.

447
00:36:01,067 --> 00:36:03,313
Lut(لوط) doesn't know what's happening.

448
00:36:03,880 --> 00:36:07,796
Lut(لوط) is speaking to these three men and he does not know what's happening.

449
00:36:09,113 --> 00:36:10,939
Because Ibn Kathir(اِبْنِ كَثِيْر) says

450
00:36:11,534 --> 00:36:18,063
that these three angels in the form of men, were given instructions by Allahسُبحانه وتعالى,

451
00:36:18,382 --> 00:36:24,735
that you do not destroy the people of Lut(لوط); until you hear the witness of their Nabi(نَبِي) against them.

452
00:36:27,133 --> 00:36:30,965
So the angels were recording everything Lut(لوط) was saying, because here's their Nabi(نَبِي),

453
00:36:31,196 --> 00:36:33,646
they have to hear what he says about them.

454
00:36:33,987 --> 00:36:36,480
He is the one, who will be asked about them on the Day of Judgment.

455
00:36:36,686 --> 00:36:42,589
So before these people are punished, they need to get the most important witness, and that is the witness of their own Nabi(نَبِي).

456
00:36:43,486 --> 00:36:47,978
So the angel was silent, and they were recording everything; Lut(لوط) was saying.

457
00:36:48,160 --> 00:36:52,302
These people are most evil people on the face of the earth, and they just are writing that down.

458
00:36:52,786 --> 00:36:56,508
They got the witness of Lut(لوط), and now they can go ahead with the punishment.

459
00:36:58,785 --> 00:37:03,069
Lut(لوط) is see that these three men are not getting the point

460
00:37:03,183 --> 00:37:06,493
and they're following him and things are getting more difficult on him.

461
00:37:07,294 --> 00:37:11,078
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى is describing to us the situation of Lut(لوط);

462
00:37:11,197 --> 00:37:28,406
وَلَمَّا جَآءَتْ رُسُلُنَا لُوطًا سِىٓءَ بِهِمْ وَضَاقَ بِهِمْ ذَرْعًا وَقَالَ هَٰذَا يَوْمٌ عَصِيبٌ۝

463
00:37:28,760 --> 00:37:33,074
And when our messengers came to Lut(لوط), he was grieved on their account.

464
00:37:33,304 --> 00:37:37,939
And he was feeling pressure, he was feeling uncomfortable.

465
00:37:38,820 --> 00:37:43,095
Imagine the situation of Lut(لوط) very difficult situation he needs to protect these three men.

466
00:37:43,523 --> 00:37:47,372
And then he took them into his house and he closed the doors; nobody saw them.

467
00:37:48,651 --> 00:37:50,796
So who leaked the news?

468
00:37:51,685 --> 00:37:52,812
The wife of Lut(لوط).

469
00:37:54,137 --> 00:37:59,771
The wife of Lut(لوط) left and she went to the people of Lut(لوط)

470
00:37:59,949 --> 00:38:03,893
and she told them that there are three handsome men in our house.

471
00:38:06,112 --> 00:38:08,366
She was collaborating with them;

472
00:38:08,945 --> 00:38:12,158
ضَرَبَ اللَّهُ مَثَلًا لِلَّذينَ كَفَرُوا امرَأَتَ نوحٍ وَامرَأَتَ لوطٍ ۖ

473
00:38:12,182 --> 00:38:13,312
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

474
00:38:13,523 --> 00:38:18,745
The example of the non believing woman is the wife of Noh(نوح) and the wife of Lut(لوط).

475
00:38:19,182 --> 00:38:20,947
She was collaborating with the people of Lut(لوط)

476
00:38:21,007 --> 00:38:24,898
and she is the one who leaked out the information that these three men are in town.

477
00:38:26,080 --> 00:38:27,776
She went and told them this.

478
00:38:28,203 --> 00:38:32,951
The news was spreading and the crowds were gathering in the streets.

479
00:38:33,673 --> 00:38:39,421
They were coming out of their clubs, rushing in the streets, crowds are rushing in the streets.

480
00:38:39,451 --> 00:38:40,778
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

481
00:38:40,913 --> 00:38:45,604
وَجَآءَ أَهْلُ ٱلْمَدِينَةِ يَسْتَبْشِرُونَ۝

482
00:38:45,648 --> 00:38:50,731
And the inhabitants of the city, came rejoicing, happy, celebrating,

483
00:38:51,072 --> 00:38:54,802
and writing and demonstrations were outside of the house of Lut(لوط).

484
00:38:55,318 --> 00:39:01,821
And there was a crowd; imagine huge crowd of men celebrating and dancing and singing;

485
00:39:01,851 --> 00:39:02,656
 يَسْتَبْشِرُونَ

486
00:39:02,686 --> 00:39:03,550
they're happy.

487
00:39:03,885 --> 00:39:06,891
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى describes this evil scene.

488
00:39:07,290 --> 00:39:08,915
And Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

489
00:39:09,081 --> 00:39:10,669
  لَعمرك

490
00:39:11,256 --> 00:39:19,491
in your life, Muhammadﷺ is the only person, whom Allahسُبحانه وتعالى makes an oath; in his life.

491
00:39:21,150 --> 00:39:26,260
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى makes an oath in anything of His creation; we can only make an oath in Allah.

492
00:39:26,995 --> 00:39:32,204
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى has made an oath and no other human being in Qur'an except Muhammadﷺ

493
00:39:32,234 --> 00:39:32,955
لَعمرك

494
00:39:33,503 --> 00:39:34,836
in your life.

495
00:39:35,146 --> 00:39:37,907
Allah is making an oath in the life of Muhammadﷺ.

496
00:39:38,161 --> 00:39:39,174
What does the Allah say?

497
00:39:39,646 --> 00:39:44,169
لَعَمرُكَ إِنَّهُم لَفي سَكرَتِهِم يَعمَهونَ۝

498
00:39:44,215 --> 00:39:52,869
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says verily by your life, they are in their wild intoxication, wondering blindly.

499
00:39:53,989 --> 00:39:58,392
Sakra(سكرة), they were drunk, but they were not drunk because of alcohol.

500
00:39:58,511 --> 00:40:06,940
They were not intoxicated because of alcohol; they were intoxicated by their lust, desires and especially sexual desires.

501
00:40:07,308 --> 00:40:11,765
They can blind the person, they can literally blind the heart.

502
00:40:12,313 --> 00:40:16,346
It can make a person drunk, obsessed, blind,

503
00:40:16,456 --> 00:40:17,639
أعمل بصيرة

504
00:40:17,829 --> 00:40:20,266
and that was the situation of the people of Lut(لوط).

505
00:40:21,242 --> 00:40:23,864
Lut(لوط) came out to his people.

506
00:40:23,894 --> 00:40:24,841
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

507
00:40:24,871 --> 00:40:38,307
وَجاءَهُ قَومُهُ يُهرَعونَ إِلَيهِ وَمِن قَبلُ كانوا يَعمَلونَ السَّيِّئَاتِ ۚ

508
00:40:38,703 --> 00:40:41,562
And his people came rushing towards him.

509
00:40:42,498 --> 00:40:44,744
Lut(لوط) told these people.

510
00:40:45,014 --> 00:40:50,330
  قال إن هؤلاء ضيفي فلا تفضحون ۝

511
00:40:50,408 --> 00:40:53,202
واتقوا الله ولا تخزون ۝

512
00:40:53,247 --> 00:40:56,147
Verily, these are my guests do not shame me.

513
00:40:56,520 --> 00:40:58,610
فَاتَّقُوا اللَّهَ وَلا تُخزونِ۝

514
00:40:58,776 --> 00:41:00,770
And fear Allah and do not disgrace me.

515
00:41:00,800 --> 00:41:03,291
What is this disgrace you're going to cause on me.

516
00:41:03,507 --> 00:41:04,946
These are my guests.

